    <task id="Id_c517956f-28a5-4638-872d-4465ddf72892" name="5.1.1 Indicar os profissionais responsáveis">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A contratante &amp;eacute; respons&amp;aacute;vel por identificar e contratar um ou mais indiv&amp;iacute;duos (de dentro de sua organiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ou de terceiros) para assumir a fun&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de gerenciamento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es com rela&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ao projeto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O escopo da fun&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de gerenciamento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es a ser realizada pelo(s) indiv&amp;iacute;duo(s) tamb&amp;eacute;m &amp;eacute; determinado pela contratante. Coletivamente, esse escopo abrange todas as atividades da parte respons&amp;aacute;vel pela nomea&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, conforme descrito na ISO 19650-2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;Eacute; importante que quem assume a fun&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de gerenciamento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es tenha o conhecimento e as habilidades necess&amp;aacute;rias.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_7723a7e3-a7b6-49b0-8094-89885087d83e</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_3e22393d-e36e-443c-a0fd-0086e5a6849d</outgoing>
      <ioSpecification id="Id_8e4a63fd-4f99-4e27-9230-54592b74e67c">
        <inputSet id="Id_f9cf7fdc-1a1c-41a7-8d58-a2a11bd889f4" />
        <outputSet id="Id_18570647-5d4b-4e51-93c6-6703c14533be" />
      </ioSpecification>
      <resourceRole id="Id_967fb7d7-3424-41f3-9e23-7a8903c4e0df">
        <q1:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q1="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">EnteFederativo</q1:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_58e20ec0-e4fe-407c-a291-c0d6208df123" name="5.1.2 Estabelecer os requisitos de informação do projeto">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Os requisitos de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do projeto (PIR) s&amp;atilde;o definidos pela contratante.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Eles identificam as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es necess&amp;aacute;rias para satisfazer os objetivos estrat&amp;eacute;gicos nos principais&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;pontos de decis&amp;atilde;o durante um projeto de design e constru&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Durante o projeto, a contratante precisa entender:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Os objetivos para os quais as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es s&amp;atilde;o necess&amp;aacute;rias. Por exemplo, para apoiar a organiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;ou o funcionamento do ativo ou para permitir que o projeto de design e constru&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o avance para o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;pr&amp;oacute;ximo est&amp;aacute;gio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. As informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es que ser&amp;atilde;o necess&amp;aacute;rias para esses fins.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A Cl&amp;aacute;usula 5.1.2 lista sete pontos de considera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o para estabelecer os requisitos de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;projeto:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. O escopo do projeto. Informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es b&amp;aacute;sicas sobre o projeto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. A finalidade pretendida para a qual as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es ser&amp;atilde;o usadas pela contratante. Os motivos pelos quais as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es s&amp;atilde;o exigidas pela parte respons&amp;aacute;vel pela indica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o durante o projeto. Uma lista de poss&amp;iacute;veis finalidades est&amp;aacute; definida na ISO 19650-1, cl&amp;aacute;usula 5.1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3. O plano de trabalho do projeto. Como o projeto ser&amp;aacute; dividido em etapas ou intervalos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;4. A rota de aquisi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o pretendida. Como as nomea&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es/contratos ser&amp;atilde;o estruturados, as rela&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es entre as partes e as regras que regem um projeto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;5. O n&amp;uacute;mero de pontos-chave de decis&amp;atilde;o ao longo do projeto Os pontos durante um projeto em que a contratante precisa de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es para tomar decis&amp;otilde;es informadas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;6. As decis&amp;otilde;es que a contratante precisa tomar em cada ponto-chave de decis&amp;atilde;o. As decis&amp;otilde;es que uma contratante pode ter de tomar durante um projeto para alcan&amp;ccedil;ar os resultados desejados, garantir a progress&amp;atilde;o do projeto e/ou retroalimentar as estrat&amp;eacute;gias mais amplas da organiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;7. As perguntas para as quais a contratante precisa de respostas, para tomar decis&amp;otilde;es informadas. Essas perguntas fornecem uma verifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o para garantir que as decis&amp;otilde;es possam ser tomadas usando as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es fornecidas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_f3d34099-4b8d-4070-b88e-8125a0b48ebd</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_b9688608-a9ca-4623-ad99-bee3db152a19</outgoing>
      <ioSpecification id="Id_a020a012-f0d0-4294-bf21-ae28d3eebe0a">
        <dataOutput id="Id_daf6d986-cca1-4aff-8f74-c086de8ab084">
          <documentation />
          <dataState id="Id_c233dc7a-b7af-4ce6-ae6c-751da5d5a14d" />
        </dataOutput>
        <inputSet id="Id_8ddf6e89-d914-4377-8e45-d217daa440b1" />
